WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:37.330
The type of person who becomes
an enemy tends to be stubborn.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.920
The enemy commander, who shouldn't
have acted so hastily,

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.880
came after us in a
half-completed mobile suit.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.640
And I beat him good!
For the time being, at least.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.720
It wasn't the Zeta Gundam's
power that did it, either.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.010
That was me!
All me!

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:57.070
GAZA STORM

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.350
This is the sector
we're currently in.

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:40.360
We believe the Argama is hiding
in a junk heap in this sector.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.610
This industrial hatch is
not currently in operation.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:47.200
Therefore, if the Argama
wishes to exit the colony,

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.780
it'll need to pass right over
our ship to return to the port.

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.040
Spare me your explanations!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.330
Calculate the shortest
distance to the Argama.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.410
We'll blast them with
the Endra's main guns!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.790
Using the ship's main guns
in a colony is overdoing it!

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:05.340
I don't care! We'll show these
people that might makes right!

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.920
Please wait, Master Mashymre!

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:15.470
I won't listen to any
new proposals here, Pampa!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.520
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.850
I can't bear it, sir!

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:23.650
When I think of ending this
without avenging our friends...!

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.360
What was the
point of us pilots...

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.110
staying up all night
assembling our mobile suits?

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:31.490
Pampa...

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:33.660
Please, sir!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:37.330
Please, give us one chance
to take down the Zeta Gundam!

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:38.160
Please, sir!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.250
You are all true knights.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.340
Lady Haman has fine men
under her command.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.130
Very well! For now,
I'll leave this to you!

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.970
Sir! Thank you, sir!

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:54.010
Thank you, sir!

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.820
Okay, Argama,
where the hell are you hiding?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.490
That kid!

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.330
We don't need to go
to the Junk Dealers Union.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:28.260
But they're in charge of that
industrial hatch, aren't they?

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.970
I'm sure they'll open it
if we explain things.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:35.180
Yeah! If the Argama doesn't escape soon,
that enemy ship will get it!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.930
The junk dealers would prefer that.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.640
Lots of scrap metal.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:43.650
Don't joke about that!
The colony would be destroyed first!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.940
Those people aren't
going to listen to reason.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:49.230
Mainly because most of
them are like that jerk Gemon!

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.570
What was that about me?!

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:53.700
I'm asking you
what's wrong with me!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.870
Um, well, that is...

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:56.580
Run!

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.410
Come back here!

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.870
Do you understand?
The eyes of Shangri-La are upon us!

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:06.330
You must fight fair and square,
and be victorious!

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:16.600
We won't fight dishonorably
and soil Lady Haman's good name!

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.010
All right! Go!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.770
Sir!

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:29.270
Gaza Storm team, moving out!

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.070
Wime! Vian! Let's try it out!

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:36.950
Yes, sir!

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:59.760
Master Mashymre, we're off!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.390
Vian! Wime! Follow me!

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:06.480
Oh, Gaza Storm...

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.230
Let your winds blow
gloriously on full blast!

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.370
Watch it. Okay?

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:28.040
Handling all this household stuff
looks pretty lame to me.

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:31.550
This ruins my image of the Argama.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:34.340
We'll end up all rusty
and covered with junk.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:38.340
It's Captain Bright's fault.
That dude is set in his ways.

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:40.680
You're a lifesaver, Mr. Chimatter.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.970
Captain!

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.020
Captain, grab it, please!

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.350
Why, you... Stop!

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.520
Stop it! Ow!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.230
Stop right there, darn it!

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.650
Damn you...!
You two! Help us!

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.660
- What should we do?
- Search me.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.160
Enemy attack?!

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:13.460
We'll check that junk heap
up ahead, just in case.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:14.670
Wime, get going!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.170
Roger.

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.220
Vian, you're with me.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.560
Report!

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.480
Two new models, sir!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:35.230
Fa will sortie in the Gundam.
Torres, you'll support her in the Methuss.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.740
What?! You mean me, sir?

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:40.240
- I said you're going out!
- Aye, sir!

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.700
- Come back!
- What a jerk!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.660
- No!
- Qum!

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.410
Little punk!

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.550
Without your mobile suit,
you're just an ordinary kid!

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.920
Those little taps
aren't doing anything!

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:00.840
Ow!

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.050
I spared you before, remember?!

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.180
The situation's different this time.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.350
Don't move!

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.680
I swear
I'll break this kid's neck!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.480
Out of the way!

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:17.570
Um...

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:19.280
Out of the way!

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:24.950
Keep them busy with the Zeta and Methuss.
We'll evacuate the civilians while you do.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:26.830
Any word from Judau?

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.620
Not yet.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.910
Roger. Zeta Gundam,
moving out!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:40.920
You've come, Zeta Gundam.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.260
Commander,
please let me take him!

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:51.430
All right. Wime, is this clear?
Fight him fairly!

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.350
Understood, sir!

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.440
We'll take him one-on-one!

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.320
Mobile suits from the Endra!

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:04.950
Look strong, Wime! Vian!
The locals are watching.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:08.740
Here they come!

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:09.910
Calm down, Torres!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.500
You practically let
me take your rear!

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:18.670
Vian!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.340
What?!

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:25.260
Vian, no! You'll look like a coward
if you shoot from behind!

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.510
What? Oh...

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.470
Why did they...?

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.520
Anyway, looks like
I got saved this time.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.150
L-Lemme go! It's cowardly to
attack from behind, isn't it?!

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.650
You think so?

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.860
No complaints now, right?!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.820
Stop it!
You're tearing me apart!

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:48.160
This is for Conte!
He was like my little brother!

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:50.030
I don't know
anything about that!

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.170
Can't shake him!
What a pilot!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:09:59.630
He's fast!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:03.550
Your move is ill-timed.

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:11.140
People of Shangri-La! We are engaging
mobile suits from the Argama!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.560
While we have an
absolute numerical advantage,

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.730
we are going
after them one-on-one...

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.560
to limit any damage to the colony!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:22.230
Compare that to the collection
of cowards from the Argama!

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:24.570
They sneak into your colony...

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.360
without any thought of the
damage that might be done to it!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.080
Oh,stop telling stupid lies!

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:33.660
You brought your own warship
into this colony, as well!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.080
Launch the Argama!

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:37.500
Captain!

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:40.250
Our honor's at stake, too!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.130
Argama, emergency launch!

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:45.510
We'll distract the enemy and
support the Zeta and the Methuss!

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.130
Aye, aye!

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:50.510
Argama, emergency launch!
All hands, stand by!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.060
You can figure it out, right?

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.310
Can we cut loose?

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:56.940
No! This isn't space!

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.480
That's what the energy
regulator is for!

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:01.820
Where's this regulator
he mentioned?

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:02.520
Maybe this.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.530
Our having to take
these emergency measures...

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.120
is due entirely to the Argama!

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:17.540
The Argama is nothing but trouble!

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:20.750
I'll show you more trouble!
Get a load of this!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.050
We ask for your
cooperation in...

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:30.970
Missed!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:32.550
Use the damn regulator!

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:35.600
Are you trying to
destroy the colony?!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.600
Citizens of Shangri-La!

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.980
Did you see the
Argama's attack just now?!

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.560
That was clearly a sucker punch!

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.900
I can't forgive that!

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:48.360
I'll fight them, even if it
means destroying this colony!

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.570
If you don't like it,
blame them!

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:14.600
Big Brother!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.560
You'd better let Judau go!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.930
Yeah, how do you like that?!

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:26.610
What are you looking at?!

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:30.610
Now you see
my true power, huh?

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:37.910
Sorry.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.210
Man, he weighs a ton!

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.620
Big Brother!

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.630
Big Brother?

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.630
You did it?

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:51.670
Okay, you all look like locals.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:53.840
Do you know where
the Argama's hiding?

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.220
Sure we do.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:13:00.140
Then will you lead me there,
in return for my helping you out?

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:01.810
Huh?

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:03.520
We don't have time for this!

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.650
Yeah. This isn't
a good time for us!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.150
What's your name?

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.110
Roux Louka, from the
La Vie en Rose.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.570
Louka from the
La Vie en Rose?

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:38.050
The bridge!
I hope it don't fall!

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:46.270
Where did those kids go?
Oh, well.

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:49.400
But I'll bet there's something
over where that flash came from.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.240
What was that
little plane just now?

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:59.910
I think it came
from around here.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:04.330
Huh? What's that?

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:10.210
Oh, come on!
That's got to be the Zeta.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:14.670
Why does my first glimpse have to be
of it getting beaten? How revolting!

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.010
Reinforcements?

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:23.560
Did they send help? And what
was that fighter plane just now?

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.560
No more frontal attacks!
Prepare to die, Zeta!

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.230
Leggo! Stop it!

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.740
I'll break you!

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:39.490
My legs!
My whole lower half came off!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.580
The pilot's still alive?

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.460
What?!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.540
I'll divert the enemy!
Run for it!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:50.920
Roger! You're a lifesaver!

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:54.760
Why, you...!

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.340
Commander, what was
that fighter just now?

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:02.470
Reinforcements from the Argama!
Forget that small fry!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.180
We're after the Zeta!
Now, where's it hiding?

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.060
What?! Again?!

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.850
Commander!
I'll take care of it!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.360
What is that fighter?!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:18.450
Zeta! Why are you just standing
there like a wooden doll?!

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.370
This is it, Zeta Gundam!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:30.790
Fa, what are you doing?!
Here! Come over here!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.800
- What's that car?
- It's coming right at us!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.590
Big Brother!

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.930
Hey! Lemme go!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:48.350
Judau!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:50.560
I'll do this,
so get some lunch ready!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.520
Of course!

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:54.020
Oh, wait! Take this.

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.360
Thank you!

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.070
What was that?
Another enemy?

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:01.950
It seems to be engaging
the enemy mobile suits.

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.160
Zeta Gundam, do you read me?

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.450
I'll take one.
You take the other two.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.790
Who are you?!
What are you saying?!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.460
Roux Louka from the La Vie en Rose.

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:14.250
From before!
You sure about this?

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:15.460
Leave this to me!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.960
This is the Zeta.
Don't get dragged into my fight!

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.470
You think it's okay
to fire guns inside a colony?!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.940
What the...?!
The ground's collapsing?!

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:40.280
You're sure it's a Core Fighter?

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.360
Aye, sir. Says it's from
the La Vie en Rose.

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.830
Tell all gun batteries to cover it!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:46.870
Sir!

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.750
Core Fighter! Get within the
Argama's firing range!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:52.250
Roger!

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.340
Energy regulator, check!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:58.880
- There's no point if it's too weak.
- It'll work!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:16:59.590
Right!

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.970
Did they do it?!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.470
- I hit him!
- Yahoo!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.600
Awesome! Huh?!
It's getting away!

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.900
Damn you, Zeta! If you won't
come out, I'll smoke you out!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:30.370
They just breached
the colony's outer wall!

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:33.330
There's gotta be sealant
on this somewhere. This one?

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:39.800
Or not! That was the vulcans!
Then maybe it's this?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.930
If that takes another hit,
it'll open a hole in the colony!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:47.640
Right!

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:54.310
I'm through letting you
do as you like!

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.520
You're back, Vian?

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:02.860
Okay! Wime!
Gaza Storm formation!

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:03.570
Sir!

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:11.740
What?

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:17.580
A technique we developed for
atmospheric combat: the Gaza Storm!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:21.090
You can't do a thing to us
inside of this smoke screen!

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.460
But, Commander...

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:25.550
How are we supposed to know
where the enemy is now?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.930
The Minovsky particles
have killed our radar!

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:32.470
I thought the smoke would
only hide our mobile suits.

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:36.350
Looks like the smoke's spreading
faster than we expected.

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:39.860
We're all in the same position,
but we have the numerical advantage!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.320
Give it your best guess!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:44.190
Even a bad gunner will hit
something if he shoots enough!

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:46.650
Roger!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.580
This is out of control!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.630
At this rate,
the colony'll be destroyed!

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:07.840
What's all this smoke?
Zeta, are you okay? Zeta!

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:11.010
No, I'm not! The colony's
going to be destroyed!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:17.140
Don't use the radio!
You'll give away your position!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.350
If we can clear--

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.770
If we can clear the smoke,
we can pick them off.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:28.650
The smoke...
The air's leaking out, so...

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.910
Of course! Okay, then!

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:34.200
Dial it down a bit,
will you?!

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:37.540
I see you!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.880
Shangri-La, forgive me!

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.560
The smoke! What happened?!

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:58.180
There you are!

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.940
Bastard! This is for Vian!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.280
And now for you!

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.290
Look out! Behind you!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.620
ZETA!

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:34.050
MASTER MASHYMRE!!!

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:47.110
Th-The Gaza Storm was wiped out?

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.240
Master Mashymre.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.110
Abort the Endra's launch.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:56.580
Our research on the Zeta Gundam
is still clearly lacking.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:12.340
That's it for the
emergency repairs.

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:16.640
Let's leave the rest for the Colony
Corporation and get back to the Argama.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:20.220
Hey! Roux, wait for me!

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:36.570
The La Vie en Rose is a
dock ship for servicing other vessels.

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:37.660
Good work.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:39.160
Captain Bright!

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:42.660
The La Vie en Rose
is waiting for the Argama.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.040
We're glad you came.
We've been waiting.

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:46.960
There you have it.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:50.630
Judau, you can get that industrial
hatch open for us, can't you?

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.920
We can't stay here any longer.

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:55.180
The enemy's gonna
attack again right away?

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:57.050
We should assume so.

00:21:57.050 --> 00:21:58.850
Okay, I'll give it a try.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:01.970
At this rate, the colony
really will be destroyed.

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:03.180
Let's go, guys.

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:04.940
Right!

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:05.810
I'm the leader here!

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:07.690
Wait! I'm coming with you!

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:09.190
Huh?

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:12.070
I got in here
in the Core Fighter.

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:13.650
You know a way out?

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:14.950
Forget it.

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:18.160
There's too big a size difference
between it and the Argama.

00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:21.200
Listen, you think that
old guy I hit is all right?

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:23.580
That guy wouldn't
die if you killed him.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:45.590
Some people are always hopeless.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:53.440
Yazan is that guy we
originally saved, right?

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:56.610
Well, this time,
he's attacking us with two Gezes.

00:23:56.610 --> 00:24:01.450
For my part, the Zeta isn't doing
what I want. Come on, work!

00:24:01.450 --> 00:24:04.620
I'm a Newtype!
It's so credulous!

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:08.920
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Funeral Bells Toll Twice."

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:12.800
Grim title, huh?

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:12.950
THE FUNERAL BELL TOLLS TWICE

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:12.950
Next Time
